Z||000002||Oreif||11-26-2000||04:49 PM||||The scoops are called, "Indy Fiero Scoop" or "SD4 street scoop" They can be bought thru IRM (1-800-367-8423) or the below website.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.showcars-bodyparts.com/fiero.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.showcars-bodyparts.com/fiero.html</A> <P>I got mine from IRM for $200 and made it functional.<BR> IRM says it's non-functional but you just cut out the opening in front and your decklid. The scoops come to fit 1984 coupes but have lines marked to fit 85-88 notchback or 86-88 fastback. (Trimming required for all except 1984)<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1986SE.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 11-26-2000).]||||reg||1
