Z||000018||AL||11-27-2000||08:21 PM||||the screen comes with the original mustang scoop,what i did is i drilled all those little holes in that screen and then left it on, so i don't get leaves in and i get heat out,install is easy but cutting my baby was hard,after that it's all easy.<B>AL</B> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/AL_sig.gif"> <P>------------------<BR> ||||reg||6
